  "sangamTamil": "இளையான் அடக்கம் அடக்கம் கிளைபொருள்\nஇல்லான் கொடையே கொடைப்பயன் - எல்லாம்\nஒறுக்கும் மதுகை உரனுடை யாளன்\nபொறுக்கும் பொறையே பொறை.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Self-restraint in youth, gifts from the poor, and forbearance in the mighty are excellent. The young man's self-restraint is self-restraint. The gift of him who owns no stores of wealth is gift indeed. When wan has means and might to punish every fault, if he forbear, call him the patient man.",
